title: Confidant
tags:
---
<<declare $player = "UserName">>
<<declare $conRank = 0>>
<<declare $conName = "DefaultConfidant">>
<<declare $conUnlocked = true>>

PersonA: Greetings, {$player}!
PersonA: I like the cut of your jib.
PersonA: My name is {$conName}.

<<if $conUnlocked>>
    PersonA: I'm glad we can talk freely.
    <<IncreaseRank Confidant>>
    PersonA: Yay! Our rank is now {$conRank}.
    
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
<<else>>
    PersonA: I'm sorry, but I can't talk to you right now.
    PersonA: You need to unlock our relationship first.
    
    -> Unlock our relationship.
        <<UnlockConfidant Confidant>>
        PersonA: Great! Now we can be friends. Our rank is {$conRank}.
        <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
    -> Goodbye.
        PersonA: Maybe next time, {$player}.
<<endif>>

===

title: ConfidantMenu
tags:
---
PersonA: What would you like to do?

-> I want to check my rank with you.
    <<AdvanceTimeSlot Confidant 1>>
    PersonA: Our current rank is {$conRank}.
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> I want to increase our rank again.
    <<if $conRank < 10>>
        <<IncreaseRank Confidant>>
        <<AdvanceTimeSlot Confidant 1>>
        PersonA: Great! Our rank is now {$conRank}.
    <<else>>
        PersonA: We're already at maximum rank!
    <<endif>>
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> I want to set our rank to 5.
    <<SetRank Confidant 5>>
    <<AdvanceTimeSlot Confidant 2>>
    PersonA: Okay, I've set our rank to {$conRank}.
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> Lock our relationship.
    <<LockConfidant Confidant>>
    PersonA: Our relationship is now locked.
    PersonA: You'll need to unlock it again to continue talking.
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> Unlock our relationship.
    <<UnlockConfidant Confidant>>
    PersonA: Our relationship is now unlocked!
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> Reset my data.
    <<ResetConfidant Confidant>>
    PersonA: I've reset our relationship data to default values.
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> Save my progress.
    <<SaveData Confidant>>
    PersonA: I've saved our current relationship progress.
    <<jump ConfidantMenu>>
-> Goodbye.
    PersonA: See you later, {$player}!

===
